{"seq":1,"slug":"legal-fundamentals","title":"法律基础","stage":"DONE","category":"law-legal","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals","rating":{"composite":3.62,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"法律基础-简介\">法律基础 简介</h1><p>法律是现代社会运行的基石，无论是日常生活中的合同签订，还是技术领域中的知识产权保护，法律知识都在其中扮演着关键角色。对于程序员和技术人员而言，理解法律的基本框架和思维方式，不仅有助于在工作中规避法律风险，更能提升跨领域沟通和决策能力。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向中级程序员以及对法律感兴趣的技术人员，旨在以清晰、系统的方式呈现法律基础知识。你不需要任何法律背景，只需具备基本的逻辑思维能力即可顺利学习。</p>\n<p>全书共分为四章，由浅入深地构建法律知识框架。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>法律体系概论</strong>从宏观视角出发，帮助你理解法律究竟是什么、世界主要法系有哪些差异、法律的来源和效力等级如何划分。这是后续学习的根基。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>法律思维方法</strong>聚焦于法律人特有的思维模式，包括法律推理、法律解释、判例分析和法律论证等核心方法论。掌握这些方法，你将具备像法律人一样分析问题的能力。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>民法基础</strong>深入最贴近日常生活的民事法律领域，涵盖民事权利体系、法律主体、法律行为以及诉讼时效等实用知识，这些内容与程序员签订劳动合同、参与创业项目等场景直接相关。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>诉讼与争议解决</strong>介绍当纠纷发生时的解决途径，从民事诉讼到仲裁、调解，再到常见法律文书的要素，帮助你在面对争议时知道该如何应对。</p>\n<p>建议按照章节顺序学习，先建立整体法律框架认知，再掌握法律思维工具，接着深入民法实体知识，最后了解程序性救济手段。每一章的知识都是下一章的基础，循序渐进方能融会贯通。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"legal-system","title":"法律体系概论","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/legal-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-law","title":"什么是法律","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/legal-system/what-is-law"},{"seq":2,"slug":"legal-systems-comparison","title":"大陆法系与英美法系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/legal-system/legal-systems-comparison"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sources-of-law","title":"法律渊源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/legal-system/sources-of-law"},{"seq":4,"slug":"legal-hierarchy","title":"法律位阶与效力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/legal-system/legal-hierarchy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"legal-thinking","title":"法律思维方法","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/legal-thinking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"legal-reasoning","title":"法律推理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/legal-thinking/legal-reasoning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"legal-interpretation","title":"法律解释方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/legal-thinking/legal-interpretation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"case-analysis","title":"判例分析方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/legal-thinking/case-analysis"},{"seq":4,"slug":"legal-argumentation","title":"法律论证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/legal-thinking/legal-argumentation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"civil-law-basics","title":"民法基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/civil-law-basics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"civil-rights","title":"民事权利体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/civil-law-basics/civil-rights"},{"seq":2,"slug":"legal-persons","title":"自然人与法人","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/civil-law-basics/legal-persons"},{"seq":3,"slug":"legal-acts","title":"法律行为与代理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/civil-law-basics/legal-acts"},{"seq":4,"slug":"limitation-of-actions","title":"诉讼时效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/civil-law-basics/limitation-of-actions"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"litigation-basics","title":"诉讼与争议解决","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/litigation-basics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"civil-litigation","title":"民事诉讼基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/litigation-basics/civil-litigation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"arbitration","title":"仲裁制度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/litigation-basics/arbitration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mediation","title":"调解与和解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/litigation-basics/mediation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"legal-documents","title":"常见法律文书","url":"/l-doc-books/h/law-legal/legal-fundamentals/litigation-basics/legal-documents"}]}]}